# =====================================================================
# SoyMutDB — Docker build context exclusions
# =====================================================================
# The build context is the repository root. It carries several generated
# `dist/` trees (apps/web/dist, apps/admin/dist, apps/jbrowse/dist); none of
# them belongs in the context, because a stale tree would be silently copied
# over the freshly built one and the context would grow by hundreds of MB.
#
# They are listed per app instead of as one `**/dist` because a broad glob is
# exactly how this file has broken builds before: an exclusion silently wins
# over a `COPY`, and the failure reads as a missing file rather than a
# context-policy mistake --
#
#   COPY failed: file not found in build context or excluded by .dockerignore
#
# `**/<name>` also matches at any depth, so a pattern written for one app's
# output can remove another app's SOURCE directory. Naming the paths keeps the
# rule auditable: `scripts/test_production_compose_contract.py` asserts both
# halves -- generated trees stay out, every Dockerfile COPY source stays in.
# =====================================================================

# --- dependencies / caches -------------------------------------------------
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
.tmp-store
**/.cache
.turbo
.venv
.pip
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
__pycache__
.pytest_cache

# --- generated app output --------------------------------------------------
# Explicit, not `**/dist`: see the header. Keep this list in sync with the
# `outDir` of each Vite config.
apps/web/dist
apps/admin/dist
apps/jbrowse/dist
apps/mcp-server/dist
**/coverage/**
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.vite

# --- artifacts / reports / local scratch -----------------------------------
artifacts
reports
.trash
.slim
*.log
.dev-logs

# --- secrets / local config ------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- VCS, editors, agents, docs, tests -------------------------------------
.git
.github
.agent-teams
.ai-memory
.opencode
.codex
docs
e2e
tests
ui-r
recreations
knip.json
eslint.config.js
AGENTS.md
README.md
